# SHUTTERBUG: Madame Scone (Teatime Planet's mid-boss) holds up the view
# until she is beaten; her falling crumbs can be shot down, and every other
# one hides a bulb. The demo player photographs her and finishes her off.
game shutterbug
cheat run 1
cheat stage 1
cheat goto 2560
cheat god
waituntil foes_29 == 1 200
waituntil hold == 1 200
botuntil eshots_2 > 0 400
botuntil stun_29 > 0 1500
botuntil foes_29 == 0 4000
expect big_kills == 1
wait 20
expect hold == 0
